# Persistent chrome + nav tests

Ordinary surfaces (Listen, Radio, Discover, Studio, Admin, Settings, Help, governance, children): keep sidebar, drawer, bottom bar, and section/subtabs mounted for the whole visit. A flash of empty chrome is a bug.

Takeover surfaces may hide chrome: full-screen player, public release/share canvases, maximized Pro Editor.

Tests on chrome views: assert nav is mounted before `aria-current` / `aria-selected`. Missing nav on takeover surfaces is correct.

Canonical text: root `AGENTS.md` (Persistent chrome + Testing); `packages/tahti-web/AGENTS.md`; `NAVIGATION-SITEMAP.md`.
